process, and adds emulators for healthcare and life science APIs. The full
history of changes is available in the emuhealth repository:
https://github.com/emuhealth/emuhealth

Third-party notices for code included in this product are listed in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

emuhealth is intended for synthetic data only. It must not be used to store or
process real patient data or other protected health information.
